    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Huuydeanda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean nea ghoahiit NG'UTAMIIDA balooldeaba ng'asheesu aba heeda Ayubu, ghwalamda NG'UTAMIIDA ak gwayeesha Elifasi bea Demani, “Naanyareekseey muuchi, ea fiisu asiyeenya iduupcheewiin aba gideaba agooga mii arukuta ng'asheega huumwa bea badaydeanyu, gawuurji gidarukuteayda Ayubu was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asi ageani jiiru ispwa, ea lagweendi ispwa, ak gooweesi siideanyu bea gadiyeeda was Ayubu, nea gooyeasi haleanjeeda sisabwa geadi bea ghadooweeda sighwarda; ak abeeda Ayubu was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda gayghamwaash aseeta, ak abeeda gaydealeeysa niny iit, ea measimaneegwa giduurji leendeedeang'wa, aba gideaba agooga mii arukuni ng'asheega doobiiweadi aba badaydeanyu, gawuurji gidarukuteayda Ayubu was siideanyu bea gadiyeeda.” ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gawa Elifaseedida bea Demani, ea Bildadeedida bea Shuhiin ea Sofaredida bea Naamatiin, ak gaweay ak gwasinda gidarukuteayda NG'UTAMIIDA, hean ghamwas NG'UTAMIIDA mooshta Ayubu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghwanung' NG'UTAMIIDA gamnyeeni Ayubu, nea nimusiicheesa fugaaschi duupchi; hean ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Ayubu haleanjeeda niba iyeenya ea gaburdeawa gea mideawa bea mwadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean gaweesa niny orjooga sean bea ghaamwat ea haweega ghaamwat, ea fuga sean nal niny aba mwadi. Ak gambuuchi sea niny aba gheanyi ak geegeandeawa salgheang'da niny aba sawanaduutka sean munyas eassa NG'UTAMIIDA niny, ak saawa gaba nih adaw niny lapiyeeni ng'ay ea ghuniida sisina dahaabu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghoadaw NG'UTAMIIDA Ayubu ghawooda aba giibindaanyi ea ghwanaawa diita bea mwadiin. Ak gaba gisil sagalamnyooji damanang'wan, ea ngamiyaji sagalamnyooji lah, ea duu sagalam ea digeen sagalam. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gwandeawa orju ispwa ea hawu samwagu ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak hudaanyi was duweacheeda gaguura gheawungaaschi Yemima, nea dea bwat badayda gaguura Gesiya, ak niirja gaguura Geren-hapuku. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba jeedeaba ng'eanyiita seaniin ea manda gadeemga miyaasiin uurji haweega Ayubu. Ak ghoadaw ghwaan saawa hearaniischooda aba bugusta orjooga ghwaan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean iing'ata ng'asheesu goobiida Ayubu badayda ng'eanyiida gweanyeew bughala ea haradam, ea ghwadaah diibigaaschi ea diibigeaba gaaschi ea ghwahita seaygooji ang'wan. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JOB 42:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghami Ayubu nea niiw gweargweeda nea gaba gweanyeeka saang'a.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOB.42.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOB.42.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
